==Strategy==
Titan Speakerman can be a good starter game [[Units|unit]] in [[Nightmare Mode]].

==Trivia==

*It is the fifth cheapest legendary to place and the second cheapest titan to place, first being [[Very Important Titan]].
*You can sell this unit for 150 Coins in the lobby.
* This was the first legendary to be added to the game.
*It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Titan_Speakerman?so=search Titan Speakerman] from the series.
*In the series, '''Titan Speakerman''' has a red suit, but in this game, he used to have a white suit with a red tie instead. This was changed when the first Halloween update released.
*It costs a total of 3950 to place and fully upgrade the '''Titan Speakerman'''.
* This is one of the 5+ titans that only have single target, others being [[Titan Cameraman]], [[Saw Upgraded Titan Cameraman]], [[Upgraded Titan Drill Man]], [[Golden Titan Speakerman]], [[Volcanic Titan]], etc.
* The [[Infected Titan Speakerman]] still has a white suit as the enemy was made before Titan Speakerman's red suit was added.
* Apparently, if you search, "[[Titan Speakerman (Disambiguation)|poopy speakerboy]]" it will redirect you to this page.

